# Design System: Dark Mode Luxury Tech

A premium, restrained, enterprise aesthetic. Define these as Tailwind v4 theme tokens
using the CSS-first `@theme` block in `app/globals.css` (no `tailwind.config.js`) —
never hardcode hex values in components.

## Core Tokens
- **Background (base):** `#0D1117` (deep slate/charcoal).
- **Surface / elevated:** slightly lighter slate for cards and panels.
- **Accent highlight:** `#00F2FE` — used sparingly for emphasis, focus, key CTAs.
- **Text:** pristine high-contrast neutrals; mute secondary text instead of lowering opacity randomly.

## Visual Rules
- Sharp, intentional borders over heavy shadows.
- Generous whitespace and a consistent spacing scale.
- One accent color, used with intent — no rainbow gradients.
- Motion (Framer Motion) must be subtle, purposeful and fast; respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.

## Examples

```ts
// ❌ BAD — hardcoded, off-system color
<div className="bg-[#111] text-[#0ff]" />

// ✅ GOOD — semantic theme tokens
<div className="bg-background text-foreground" />
<button className="text-accent ring-accent/40" />
```
